  "downloadMethod": "Official GitHub contents API at the fixed commit was used for path/blob identity; bytes came from the corresponding fixed-commit raw URL and were verified by exact size and SHA-256.",
  "scope": "Independent loader fixtures. The box variants validate packed/interleaved geometry and one embedded PNG texture path. NormalTangentTest validates a real normal map without authored tangents together with metallic-roughness, R-channel occlusion and double-sided lighting. TextureEncodingTest validates color-space texture semantics and deterministic normal generation for primitives that omit NORMAL. AlphaBlendModeTest validates authored tangent ownership plus OPAQUE, MASK and BLEND material execution. The Lab material-modes option is a self-owned runtime projection fixture derived from decoded, unmodified BoxTextured bytes; it validates core emissive and alpha renderer contracts but is not an additional upstream asset. These fixtures are not arbitrary glTF, industrial-model, renderer-quality or performance acceptance evidence.",
